      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer ice cream to a large bowl. Stir with a wooden spoon to soften. Stir in blue marshmallow mixture to create a swirl. Cover and freeze at least 8 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide ice cream between 8 bowls or sundae glasses. Top with strawberries.",
